# Reset Inbox Project takes the tag away: the Navigator lists the project among the projects at once, focused while the pane is zoomed into it, and gi says there is no inbox.
size 100 30
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Report
END
keys gi :
type reset inbox project
keys <Enter>
status No inbox project now
keys <C-g>
see Projects
see │▌ INBOX                                     1 │
hide 󰚇
keys <Esc> gi
status No inbox project: use Select Inbox Project
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Report
END
